  "goodToKnow": "Der Einspruch is an objection: Einspruch einlegen (to lodge an objection), Einspruch erheben. In German administration, you can object to a tax assessment (Steuerbescheid) within one month; for many other official decisions, the formal term is Widerspruch. Einspruch, Euer Ehren! is the dubbed phrase from American courtroom dramas; real German courts don't work like that. Einspruch stattgegeben means objection sustained. Plural: die Einsprüche."
